# Environment variables for frickeldave.github.io

# GitHub Personal Access Token for MCP Server
# Create your token at: https://github.com/settings/tokens
# Required scopes for issue administration: 
# - repo (full access to repository data)
# - read:org (read organizational data)
# - read:user (read user profile data)
# - user:email (access user email addresses)
# - public_repo (access public repositories)
# - repo:status (access commit statuses)
GITHUB_MCP_TOKEN=your_github_personal_access_token_here